@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ggen: <https://praxis.chatman.com/ontology/ggen#> .
@prefix wf: <https://praxis.chatman.com/ontology/workflow#> .

wf:DynamicSystem a ggen:OntologyObject ;
    ggen:isMathematicallyAdmitted "true" ;
    ggen:leanProofTarget "PairCorrelation.DynamicSystem" .

# wf:MixingOrbitsIID removed 2026-07-13 (self-audit Pass 23, finding G3): the Lean
# declaration it pointed at, PairCorrelation.mixing_orbits_asymptotic_iid, was a vacuous
# theorem (all hypotheses unused; conclusion trivially witnessed regardless of hypothesis
# truth) and was deleted in commit 252063e. That deletion left this entity still
# asserting ggen:isMathematicallyAdmitted "true" for a nonexistent, never-legitimately-
# admitted declaration, with two downstream consequences (STOCHASTIC_LOAD_PREDICTION,
# IID_CACHE_PREDICTOR) chained off a claim that was never honest. Removed rather than
# marked false: it was not a real theorem that later failed, it was vacuous from the
# start (AGENTS.md section 3, no vacuous tautologies).
